{{BD|Focus}} is a [[Buff]] that improves the power of your non-{{KW|Plasma}} Orbs. It affects the values listed above for {{KW|Lightning}}, {{KW|Frost}}, and {{KW|Dark}} Orbs, except for the base damage value for {{KW|Dark}} Orbs, which is always 6. Functioning very similarly to {{BD|Strength}} and {{BD|Dexterity}}, Focus may be positive or negative, acting as an offset for the values in the appropriate direction, to a minimum of 0.

As Focus can improve both your damage and {{KW|Block|Blocking}} capabilities, it may serve as extremely potent scaling.

