Playing {{C|The Bomb}} multiple times will give a separate single stack of {{BD|The Bomb}} each time.

== Obtaining The Bomb ==
{{C|The Bomb}} is a {{QueryLink|Cards|color:Colorless|Colorless}} card, and therefore can be obtained in the following ways:
* Can be bought from the [[Merchant]].
* Can appear in the {{E|Sensory Stone}} event, from a choice of 3-9 {{QueryLink|Cards|color:Colorless|Colorless}} cards, depending on the option that is selected.
* Can be obtained from [[Monsters]], [[Elites]] and [[Bosses]] with {{R|Prismatic Shard}}.
** Also found in the [[Custom Mode|Daily Climb]] with the {{KW|Diverse}} or {{KW|Colorless Cards}} modifiers.
* Can be obtained from Neow's [[Third Blessing]] in exchange for a negative effect.

== Interactions ==
=== Order ===
{{BD|The Bomb}} activates before the enemy turn. On top of happening before enemy intents, it will also activate before:
* Before {{BD|Invincible}} resets
* Before {{BD|Poison}} activates

When alongside other [[Buffs]] or [[Debuffs]] which activate at the end of the player's turn, {{BD|The Bomb}} activates in the order the buffs were gained. This includes:
* {{BD|Regen}}
* {{BD|Constricted}}
* {{BD|Combust}}
* {{BD|Omega}}

=== Neutral ===
* This damage is not affected by {{BD|Vulnerable}}, {{BD|Strength}}, or {{BD|Double Damage}}.

