{{BD|Weak}} is a [[Debuff]] that reduces the damage of {{QueryLink|Cards|type:Attack|Attack}} cards and enemy [[Intent|Intents]] by 25% (typically).

Each point of {{BD|Weak}} increases how many turns the debuff is active for.

Note: Since damage rounds down, '''Weak''' can be especially effective against multi-attacking enemies (i.e. 5x3 becomes 3x3, for a damage reduction of 40%).

